    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stdout": "Extract XML-only atomic capability keys for commerce precheck. This command\r\nplans only; it does not execute draft edits or charge.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --workspace TEXT:DIR \r\n                              Blueprint workspace directory. Required for\r\n                              --selection/--selection-file; optional for\r\n                              --target-xml/--target-xml-file from-empty extraction.\r\n          --selection TEXT Excludes: --target-xml-file --selection-file --target-xml \r\n                              Inline Selection Expression ending in draft.apply().\r\n          --selection-file TEXT:FILE Excludes: --target-xml-file --selection --target-xml \r\n                              File containing one Selection Expression program.\r\n          --target-xml TEXT Excludes: --target-xml-file --selection --selection-file \r\n                              Inline target/candidate Xmldraft XML.\r\n          --target-xml-file TEXT:FILE Excludes: --selection --selection-file --target-xml \r\n                              Target/candidate Xmldraft XML file.\r\n          --current-xml-file TEXT:FILE \r\n                              Optional baseline current Xmldraft XML file. Defaults to\r\n                              workspace current_draft.xml when available.\r\n          --allow-existing-main-deletion \r\n                              Allow explicit deletion or reassignment of existing main segments\r\n                              during capability extraction.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint commerce --workspace ./bp_ws\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint commerce --workspace ./bp_ws --selection-file ./edit.selection\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft blueprint commerce --workspace ./bp_ws --target-xml-file ./candidate.xml\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use this command before blueprint apply to map XML-only edit capabilities to commerce benefit tuples.\r\n",
